@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Inbound WhatsApp Webhook - Confirm Appointment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "context_id": "MSG_WHATSAPP_SAMPLE_001",
    "payload": "CONFIRM"
}

###

### Inbound WhatsApp Webhook - Cancel Appointment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "context_id": "MSG_WHATSAPP_SAMPLE_002",
    "payload": "CANCEL"
}

###

### Inbound Webhook - Unrecognized Message / Log Not Found (Sad Path)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/whatsapp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "context_id": "NON_EXISTENT_MESSAGE_ID",
    "payload": "CONFIRM"
}
